b: X.XXX ms Call timeLog for 'b' and then stop it.
b: X.XXX ms
Start timer'b' again
Stop timers 'a' and 'b'.
b: X.XXX ms
a: X.XXX ms

SELECT JS_CLEAR_CONSOLE_LOG();
JS_CLEAR_CONSOLE_LOG()
